oy Magazine","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/069170916c98748b7b3e33b80bd7d689.png","desc":"Faster reload when the magazine is nearly empty."},{"name":"Flared Magwell","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/f95e67e4ff37466505d66d3fa1030782.png","desc":"Optimized for fast reloading.\n  •  Slightly increases stability\n  •  Greatly increases reload speed"}]},{"label":"Trait","weight":3,"perks":[{"name":"Genesis","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/087a911353a3586f5346a1cf88d8de05.png","desc":"Breaking a combatant's shield with this weapon fills its magazine from reserves. Energy weapons regenerate ammo on hit when matching the damage type to the combatant's shield."},{"name":"Slideways","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/531db7656c3f2ed054898e141d85b801.png","desc":"Sliding partially reloads this weapon's magazine and temporarily boosts handling and stability."},{"name":"Threat Detector","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/9611bdbc48aff898193fd5f705c7cf30.png","desc":"Increased reload, stability, and handling when enemies are in close proximity."},{"name":"Subsistence","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/eaa8f4295a71bf47df7ffd8599f7af4d.png","desc":"Defeating targets partially reloads the magazine from reserves."},{"name":"Triple Tap","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/0795f44c0c3611b15428742c67918cd1.png","desc":"Rapidly landing precision hits will return one round to the magazine."}]},{"label":"Trait","weight":3,"perks":[{"name":"Eye of the Storm","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/8f4755f9068959b26b8829641e5725ad.png","desc":"This weapon becomes more accurate and boosts handling as your health gets lower."},{"name":"High-Impact Reserves","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/33ed859a08f2ccf643a1ac3c7f201966.png","desc":"Rounds at the end of the magazine deal more damage."},{"name":"Disruption Break","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/45b57ce27fa0213218c7cb8f2253c517.png","desc":"Breaking an enemy's shield with this weapon makes them more vulnerable to Kinetic damage for a brief period."},{"name":"Vorpal Weapon","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/bc5130b227ee577f2678ec2d2c97bf4a.png","desc":"Increased damage against bosses, vehicles, and Guardians with their Super active."},{"name":"Rampage","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/8976ead57430e4f5f8af1b3005de4f83.png","desc":"Kills with this weapon temporarily grant increased damage. Stacks 3x."}]}],"notes":["[YeezyGT's S16] [MW: Reload/Range] \"One of the coolest, best-shadering Hand Cannons in the franchise, that's thoroughly under-appreciated due to a fairly stale PvE meta for 180RPMs lacking explosive ammunition. Honestly, there's a lot going for this gun in a 20% Vorpal buff, Rampage, Triple Tap, Subsistence, and even Threat Detector -- on top of that, Warmind Cell creation is still very much on the menu. I think if 180s were given a chance to shine (outside of seasons where they're an Overload damage type), the IKELOS_HC would see some great success.\" tags:pve","File auto generated from csv pandapaxxy-s15-roundup (tags: controller,god-pve)","File auto generated from csv pandapaxxy-s15-roundup (tags: controller,god-pvp)","File auto generated from csv pandapaxxy-s15-roundup (tags: god-pvp)","File auto generated from csv pandapaxxy-s15-roundup (tags: controller,pve)","File auto generated from csv pandapaxxy-s15-roundup (tags: controller,pvp)","File auto generated from csv pandapaxxy-s15-roundup (tags: pvp)"],"modes":{"all":{"rolls":[[4,11,21,24],[4,11,22,27],[2,11,22,27],[2,11,22,28],[2,11,23,27],[2,11,23,28],[2,13,22,27],[2,13,22,28],[2,13,23,27],[2,13,23,28],[2,14,22,27],[2,14,22,28],[2,14,23,27],[2,14,23,28],[4,11,20,24],[4,11,20,25],[4,11,21,25],[4,11,22,28],[4,11,23,27],[4,11,23,28],[4,12,20,24],[4,12,20,25],[4,12,21,24],[4,12,21,25],[4,13,22,27],[4,13,22,28],[4,13,23,27],[4,13,23,28],[4,14,22,27],[4,14,22,28],[4,14,23,27],[4,14,23,28],[8,11,20,24],[8,11,20,25],[8,11,21,24],[8,11,21,25],[8,11,22,27],[8,11,22,28],[8,11,23,27],[8,11,23